<title>POLAND: Irena 1996 net falls to PLN 6.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Irena 1996 net falls to PLN 6.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irena preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>    JANUARY-DECEMBER			 1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.20 vs    4.37</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   9.62 vs    9.95</p>
<p>    net profit				 6.74 vs    7.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Huta Szkla Gospodarczego Irena SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 60.77 vs   51.37</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  46.10 vs   38.64</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.45 vs    0.07 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.87 vs    2.81</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    77.04 vs   70.44</p>
<p>    financial costs			 73.13 vs   64.92</p>
<p>    investment				81.71 vs   79.13</p>
